1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 7=

10
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:06,070
Trying to escape?

11
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:07,640
In your dreams.

12
00:01:09,630 --> 00:01:10,200
Go!

13
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:13,790
Or none of us will make it out alive.

14
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:15,310
Go!

15
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:18,950
Go!

16
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:20,220
- Hurry!
- Come on!

17
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:37,710
If I hadn't stubbornly gone my own way,

18
00:01:41,790 --> 00:01:43,110
Mei Qi wouldn't have died.

19
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,540
While serving under Cui Hong,

20
00:01:50,540 --> 00:01:52,430
you saved so many women
who nearly became his victims.

21
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:54,620
You and Mei Qi

22
00:01:56,580 --> 00:01:57,500
both did well.

23
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:02,420
The path of vengeance has always
been fraught with danger.

24
00:02:04,230 --> 00:02:04,830
Your life

25
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,420
was bought with Mei Qi's life.

26
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:10,830
You need to understand
how important your life is.

27
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:13,780
Mei Qi's life
was just as important as mine.

28
00:02:17,670 --> 00:02:18,900
Of course her life was important.

29
00:02:20,670 --> 00:02:21,980
But what's done is done.

30
00:02:23,010 --> 00:02:24,800
The Shen family's
great wrong has yet to be avenged.

31
00:02:26,180 --> 00:02:28,060
Are you really going
to give up before it's over?

32
00:02:38,590 --> 00:02:39,230
Your life

33
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:42,700
is one I snatched back
from the jaws of death.

34
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:46,470
And Mei Qi gave her life for yours.

35
00:02:48,590 --> 00:02:50,470
You must fulfill your mission.

36
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:53,260
Only then will Mei Qi's
sacrifice not have been in vain.

37
00:03:07,460 --> 00:03:08,300
Drink the porridge.

38
00:03:10,510 --> 00:03:11,260
Pull yourself together.

39
00:03:13,830 --> 00:03:15,420
Let's see Mei Qi off
on her final journey.

40
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:26,140
(Cui Hong.)

41
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:28,580
(For every life you took,)

42
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:31,740
(I'll make you pay, one by one.)

43
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:34,630
(Cang Ying.)

44
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:37,070
(Just you wait.)

45
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:42,460
(Spirit Tablet of My Late Friend Mei Qi)

46
00:03:43,790 --> 00:03:44,510
I'm sorry.

47
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:47,360
It's not your fault.

48
00:03:49,070 --> 00:03:49,900
If anyone is to blame,

49
00:03:51,260 --> 00:03:52,830
blame this cruel world
that devours people.

50
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,300
A woman's life

51
00:03:56,690 --> 00:03:57,960
is worth no more than a blade of grass.

52
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:00,790
When we were young,

53
00:04:02,630 --> 00:04:05,020
Father despised us
simply because we were girls

54
00:04:06,010 --> 00:04:07,170
and were daughters of a concubine.

55
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:09,790
He never treated us kindly.

56
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,710
That year during the Qingming Festival,

57
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:15,260
Father's wife pretended to let us
visit our birth mother's grave,

58
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:18,020
but she had already
hired human traffickers.

59
00:04:18,830 --> 00:04:19,630
Get in there!

60
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:21,670
Once you walk through that door,

61
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:24,190
forget about keeping your virtue.

62
00:04:24,790 --> 00:04:26,910
Obey, and you'll be fed.

63
00:04:27,390 --> 00:04:28,510
Disobey,

64
00:04:29,350 --> 00:04:31,670
and I'll make you suffer terribly.

65
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:45,230
Don't be afraid.

66
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:47,950
I'm here. I'll protect you.

67
00:04:50,630 --> 00:04:51,700
Sis.

68
00:04:55,140 --> 00:04:57,300
If you hadn't come to our aid back then,

69
00:04:58,700 --> 00:04:59,510
Mei Qi and I

70
00:05:00,580 --> 00:05:02,350
would have eventually
been tormented to death.

71
00:05:05,410 --> 00:05:07,650
We even planned how we would die.

72
00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:09,650
We would end each other's lives

73
00:05:09,790 --> 00:05:11,490
and spare each other a painful death.

74
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:15,870
Anything was better than
being humiliated over and over

75
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:17,830
until we were barely human anymore.

76
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:21,390
So how could I blame you?

77
00:05:26,260 --> 00:05:27,350
I can only blame this world.

78
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:28,990
Why

79
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:33,750
should women be deemed
inferior to men from birth?

80
00:05:34,460 --> 00:05:35,220
Why

81
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:39,340
is it so difficult for us

82
00:05:39,340 --> 00:05:40,900
to live with dignity

83
00:05:43,580 --> 00:05:44,870
and freedom?

84
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:49,310
In these troubled times,

85
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:51,310
a woman's life

86
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:53,830
drifts like duckweed.

87
00:05:55,780 --> 00:05:57,940
(Zhao Residence)

88
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:12,430
(Miss Hanyi,)

89
00:06:12,700 --> 00:06:14,510
(while I was with you
treating Madam Zhao,)

90
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:16,830
(I happened to see
one of Madam Zhao's servants)

91
00:06:16,990 --> 00:06:19,340
(burying something beneath
the peach tree in her own courtyard.)

92
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:20,990
(She was acting very suspiciously.)

93
00:06:59,830 --> 00:07:00,630
Hanyi!

94
00:07:02,220 --> 00:07:02,750
Hanyi!

95
00:07:04,340 --> 00:07:04,870
Hanyi.

96
00:07:05,870 --> 00:07:06,950
This has nothing to do with you.

97
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:08,560
Don't look into it any further.

98
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:09,780
Come back with me.

99
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:11,220
Let's go.

100
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:13,900
So many lives were lost, Master.

101
00:07:16,390 --> 00:07:16,780
Let's go!

102
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:17,700
Master.

103
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:25,020
So you found out after all.

104
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:26,830
You're mad!

105
00:07:29,070 --> 00:07:29,830
You're mad!

106
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:32,260
Murderer!

107
00:07:32,550 --> 00:07:34,140
You're a murderer!

108
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:36,830
What gave you the right to do this?

109
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:38,140
What right?

110
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:40,630
What right?

111
00:07:44,550 --> 00:07:47,340
I wanted Zhao Wujiu's
family line to end with him.

112
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:50,580
Concubine Liu.

113
00:07:53,070 --> 00:07:55,510
You killed
Concubine Liu too, didn't you?

114
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:57,020
That's right.

115
00:07:57,630 --> 00:07:58,700
It was me.

116
00:08:01,660 --> 00:08:04,070
Zhao Wujiu is a monster.

117
00:08:05,700 --> 00:08:07,260
Both times I became pregnant,

118
00:08:08,190 --> 00:08:11,630
he forced himself on me
without any regard for my condition.

119
00:08:13,830 --> 00:08:16,390
He took away my chance to be a mother.

120
00:08:17,390 --> 00:08:20,390
So I took away
his chance to be a father.

121
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:22,780
That's only fair!

122
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:37,140
Madam!

123
00:08:38,700 --> 00:08:39,340
Madam!

124
00:08:40,190 --> 00:08:40,830
Madam!

125
00:08:42,070 --> 00:08:42,830
Madam!

126
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:48,340
For the sins I've committed,

127
00:08:50,140 --> 00:08:54,140
I'm willing to descend
into the deepest depths of hell

128
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:58,900
to atone for them.

129
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:05,460
Madam!

130
00:09:06,390 --> 00:09:08,700
- Madam!
- You...

131
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:10,390
You deserve to die!

132
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:13,990
You deserve to die!

133
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:17,260
Hanyi!

134
00:09:22,070 --> 00:09:22,660
Madam!

135
00:09:23,140 --> 00:09:23,700
Hanyi.

136
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:24,700
Madam.

137
00:09:25,990 --> 00:09:26,580
Hold on.

138
00:09:27,550 --> 00:09:28,700
I'll take you home.

139
00:09:46,950 --> 00:09:48,030
Man-eating flower.

140
00:10:22,150 --> 00:10:23,190
(Xie Yungui.)

141
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:26,190
(For what you owe,)

142
00:10:27,830 --> 00:10:29,380
(you'll have to pay sooner or later.)

143
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:53,180
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

144
00:10:53,940 --> 00:10:56,880
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

145
00:10:57,540 --> 00:11:00,360
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

146
00:11:01,210 --> 00:11:04,200
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

147
00:11:05,050 --> 00:11:08,370
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

148
00:11:08,710 --> 00:11:12,000
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

149
00:11:12,350 --> 00:11:18,830
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

150
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:26,710
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

151
00:11:29,210 --> 00:11:37,060
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

152
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:39,170
♪I stand here today♪

153
00:11:39,310 --> 00:11:43,820
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

154
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:51,310
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

155
00:11:51,950 --> 00:11:53,240
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

156
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:55,640
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

157
00:11:56,080 --> 00:12:02,930
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
